    card title "Where are you going?"

A: How do you ask where someone is going, in Russian? Tom meets Masha in the street; let's listen.
    draw masha masha_name tom tom_name

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: Куда́ means where to. You know где, where something is; куда́ asks where you're heading.
    highlight talk_1_words effect underline color #8f887c part Куда́

    draw talk

B: Иду́ is I'm going, on foot. And рабо́та is work, the noun of рабо́тать, to work.
    highlight talk_3_words effect underline color #8f887c part иду́

    erase talk

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

    draw talk2

A: Кино́ is the cinema. Two new things carry all this: the verb идти́, and a new job for the у ending.
    highlight talk2_2_words effect underline color #8f887c part кино́

    erase talk2

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

A: Here is идти́, to go on foot: я иду́, ты идёшь, он идёт, мы идём, вы идёте, они́ иду́т.
    draw walker walker_lbl v1 v2 v3 v4 v5 v6

B: It goes just like живу́ from lesson twenty-three: ё where the stress falls on the ending, идёшь, идёт, like живёшь, живёт.
    highlight v2 v3 v4 v5 effect underline color #2f6b8f part ё

A: And я and они́ end in у, иду́ and иду́т, where чита́ю has ю.
    highlight v1 v6 effect underline color #2f6b8f

    erase verb walker walker_lbl

B: Мой брат идёт в шко́лу.
    draw p_school s1

    draw l_school

A: Шко́ла, school, ends in а, so heading there it takes lesson fourteen's у: в шко́лу, like ви́жу ма́му.
    highlight l_school effect underline color #8f887c part "в шко́лу"

    erase s1 s1_g_1 s1_g_2 s1_g_3 s1_g_4 s1_g_5

B: Ма́ма идёт на рабо́ту.
    draw p_work s2

    draw l_work

A: Рабо́та does the same, but with на, not в. Learn на рабо́ту as one piece.
    highlight l_work effect underline color #3f7d4e part ^на$

    erase s2 s2_g_1 s2_g_2 s2_g_3 s2_g_4 p_work l_work

    move p_school l_school by [-50,0] duration 0.6

    draw c2_change

A: Парк, the park, is different: a he-word, and a thing, so it stays as it is: в парк.
    draw p_park l_park c2_stay

B: And кино́ never changes at all: в кино́ is where you are, and where you're going.
    draw p_cinema l_cinema

    erase p_school l_school p_park p_cinema l_park l_cinema c2_change c2_stay

    draw h_gde

A: Now set куда́ beside где. I (@draw g1@)n lesson twenty-three, я живу́ в Москве́: where you are takes е.

A: Going there, it's в Москву́.
    draw h_kuda k1

B: Going by bus or train has its own verb in Russian; that comes later.
    draw bus

    erase bus

B: Рестора́н: в рестора́не when you're inside, в рестора́н on the way there.
    draw g2 k2 g3 k3

A: So the question picks the ending. Где asks where you are, and the place takes е.
    highlight g1 effect underline color #d0865f part е$

A: Куда́ asks where you're going, and an а-word takes у; a я-word takes ю.
    highlight k1 effect underline color #3f7d4e part у$

    hide board

    draw q_walk

    quiz "Masha asks where Tom is heading: ___ ты идёшь? Which word starts it?" reveal.text "Куда́ ты идёшь?" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Куда́, where to: где would ask where he is right now.
        wrong: She isn't asking where he is, but where he's going.
        * Где
        + Куда́
        * Когда́

    erase q_walk reveal_1_stamp

    draw q_school

    ask "Masha's brother walks to school. Type the missing word: Брат идёт в ___." answer ["школу"] reveal.text "в шко́лу" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Шко́лу: going there, the а of шко́ла becomes у.
        wrong: Start from шко́ла; heading there, what happens to its last letter?

    erase q_school reveal_2_stamp

    draw q_park

    quiz "Dad is going to the park. Па́па идёт в ___. Which is right?" reveal.text "в парк" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Парк: a he-word that's a thing stays as it is after в.
        wrong: Does парк end in а?
        + парк
        * па́рку
        * па́рке

    erase q_park reveal_3_stamp

    draw q_cinema

    ask "Type we are going: Мы ___ в кино́." answer ["идём","идем"] reveal.text "мы идём в кино́" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        keys: АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
        right: Идём: the мы form, with the ё of идёшь and идёт.
        wrong: It starts like иду́ and ends like чита́ем, with ё.

    erase q_cinema reveal_4_stamp

    draw q_city

    quiz "Now Tom says where he lives. Я живу́ в ___. Which is right?" reveal.text "живу́ в Москве́" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Москве́: живу́ says where you are, so е; в Москву́ is for going there.
        wrong: Is Tom there, or on his way?
        * Москва́
        + Москве́
        * Москву́

    erase q_city reveal_5_stamp

    draw recap parallel true

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

    erase recap

    show board

A: So a Russian place tells you more than where: в Москве́, you're there; в Москву́, you're on your way.
    highlight g1 k1 effect underline color #8f887c

    hide board

A: Куда́ ты идёшь?
    draw end_masha end_tom parallel true

B: Я иду́ в кино́! Пока́!
    icon end_cinema size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["clapper board","film frames"] icon_look picture of cinema

